1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:08,000
WeatherGate: a 2D RPG where real weather gates your progress

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Move your hero with WASD or the arrow keys

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
A river and a wall block the path to the Magic Gate

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Touch the gate - the game pauses and the AI challenge opens

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Live Open-Meteo weather sets the risk multiplier

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Choose an Action Card, or type your own move

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,000
AI Validators are judging your action against the weather

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Pass - confetti, a GEN reward, and the gate swings open

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Reckless in bad weather? The verdict fails and the gate stays locked

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Built on GenLayer - trustless, weather-driven adjudication
